Package: lingmo-compositor
Architecture: any
Depends: lingmo-toolkit,
         lingmo-framework,
         ${misc:Depends},
         ${shlibs:Depends}
Recommends: xwayland,
            pipewire-bin
Description: Lingmo OS Wayland compositor and desktop shell
 The Lingmo desktop's display server: DRM/KMS output, input, window
 management, server-side decorations, animations and the lock screen, with
 the status bar, dock, launcher, notifications and screen capture built in.
 X11 applications run through Xwayland when it is installed.
